  "subject": "Supersedes the 2026-05-27-0030 renumber directive — PO + catdef-strategist executed the renumber + counter bump directly via wrangler 2026-05-27 ~12:15; queue verified clean (CA-017 in place of colliding CA-015); meta.ca_nnn_counter advanced to 17; no action required from canonical-implementor on the renumber directive",

